  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">La unitat de prevenci&oacute; comunit&agrave;ria de conductes addictives (UPCCA) de la Mancomunitat Espad&agrave; Millars (MEM) va organitzar un concurs de cartells sobre el Dia Mundial Sense Tabac, dirigit a l&rsquo;alumnat de 5&egrave; i 6&egrave; de Prim&agrave;ria del CRA Espad&agrave; Millars (Tales, Suera, Fanzara i Ludiente) i del col&middot;legi Riu Millars de Ribesalbes. En el primer cas ha guanyat Andrea Palanques Ramos i, al centre de Ribesalbes, Noah Madrid Centelles.</font></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscartellstabacmanco/img_3101.jpg\" alt=\"img_3101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscartellstabacmanco/img_3102.jpg\" alt=\"img_3102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscartellstabacmanco/img_3105.jpg\" alt=\"img_3105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscartellstabacmanco/img_3108.jpg\" alt=\"img_3108\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscartellstabacmanco/img_3110.jpg\" alt=\"img_3110\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscartellstabacmanco/img_3111.jpg\" alt=\"img_3111\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscartellstabacmanco/img_3112.jpg\" alt=\"img_3112\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concurscartellstabacmanco/img_3114.jpg\" alt=\"img_3114\" sty